        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DHS3035 3 x 3-1/2 Solid Brass Half Surface Hinge</b>\r\n<p>\r\nUsed For installing a new door or screen door into existing frame. \r\nOne leaf screw mounts on the door jam, the other screw mounts on surface of door (door face).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching solid brass flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 1\" wood screws and standard removable button tip finials. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, rust resistant, stainless steel pin.\r\n Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood frame doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Half Surface</li>\r\n<li>Door flange surface applied</li>\r\n<li>Jamb flange mortise to jamb</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 9</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DHS3035.pdf?v=1691095330\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DHS3035 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DHS3035.jpg?v=1704354532\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSH3035 Hinge Specifications\"></p>\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer 9 different finishes for this Hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't forget to look at <a href=\"/collections/deltana-brass-hinge-finials\">Deltana's great Finial tips</a> to spice up your hinges!\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
